   "lines": [
    "Sparred with",
    "Tucker Burr, using",
    "him up.",
    "In the afternoon",
    "Dick Saltonstall",
    "drove me in a",
    "buggy over to his",
    "house on Chestnut",
    "Hill, where I am",
    "now, enjoying",
    "myself to the ut-",
    "most. All his",
    "family are just",
    "too sweet to me",
    "for anything, and",
    "the whole house is",
    "so homelike."
   ],
